{
  "about": "The health screens: rings, a day's clock, meters, strips, ranges, heatmaps, a scatter, and figures that hold a ring or a chart. They are parts like any other: found by id, changed by ops, their hints as they came. A day pager steps to another day in place: the screen takes the other day's page, and the stack does not grow. A figure's action is a link like any other.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "note": "The app starts and asks for its shell.",
      "send": {"t":"start"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":1,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/_navree/native/shell","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=0; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The shell arrives: its destinations, and the first one's first screen is asked for.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":1,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/shell-health.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"app"},
          {"t":"nav"},
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":2,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=0; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The Today screen, as the protocol's own example has it.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":2,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "../../../navree-native/corpus/screen-today.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The person steps to the day before: the client sends the pager's own address. The screen stays where it is in its stack and asks for that day; what it shows stays until the answer is here. A hint is in the tree as it came.",
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":1,"action":{"t":"navigate","href":"/?date=2026-11-12"}},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":3,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/?date=2026-11-12","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=0; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/destinations/0/stack","is":[1]},
        {"at":"/screens/1/url","is":"/?date=2026-11-12"},
        {"at":"/screens/1/loading","is":true},
        {"at":"/screens/1/content/t","is":"native"},
        {"at":"/screens/1/content/screen/body/children/3/children/0/children/0/hint/about","is":"the health score"},
        {"at":"/screens/1/content/screen/body/children/3/children/0/children/0/hint/title","is":"How the score is made"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"response","request":3,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/day-before.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/destinations/0/stack","is":[1]},
        {"at":"/screens/1/title","is":"Thursday"}
      ]
